            "tier_intro": "<p>Recommended forged 20\" street fitments for G20 / G22 / G42. Square setups help mitigate understeer and let you rotate tires front-to-rear for longer life. Staggered setups prioritize rear grip and traction — wheels and tires cannot be rotated front to rear, and large staggers may induce understeer.</p>",
