            "tier_title": "Performance Street & Track — Square",
            "tier_intro": "<p>Whether you enjoy spirited street driving or you are a weekend track warrior chasing lap times, these forged wheel and tire configurations deliver a more dramatic step up in performance — typically paired with performance-oriented summer tires or track-oriented R-compounds.</p><p>Suspension, alignment, and tire choice can be tuned for street or track. Many fitments run on factory alignment, but if you plan to track the car we highly recommend dialing in negative camber for handling and tire life.</p><p>Square configurations help mitigate understeer and allow front/rear tire rotation. They may compromise rear-end grip versus staggered setups.</p>",
            "a_label": "Square · 18\"",
            "a_front": "18x9 ET25",
            "a_rear": "18x9 ET25",
            "a_notes": "Popular forged 18\" square fitment. 3–5mm front spacers may be required with certain aftermarket suspensions that reduce inner clearance. Alternative tire: 245/45-18 front & rear (direct fit, X-Drive compatible).",
